== Effects ==
* +1 [[damage]].
* Isaac's tears become rocks that have extra knockback and have a chance to destroy [[obstacles]] (including walls to {{R|Secret Room}}s, entrances to {{s|Mines}}/{{s|Ashpit}} and [[Bedroom]]s, and normal closed doors).
** Rocks can be pushed onto holes to cover them as if they were bombed normally.
* Rock tears randomly deal increased/decreased damage, ranging between ×0.5 and ×2 Isaac's damage per tear.

== Notes ==
* Despite the chance to deal lower damage per shot, the increase to the damage stat results in a higher average DPS.
* Terra bypasses {{e|Blaster}}s' 75% damage reduction.
* Terra can destroy the armor of {{e|Tuff Twins}} and {{e|The Shell}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{t|Broken Padlock}}: Locked doors can be opened by shooting at them.
* {{I|Finger!}}: The finger will destroy rocks.
* {{I|The Ludovico Technique}}: Controllable rock tear that will destroy rocks. The size of the tear changes per room.
* {{i|Mom's Knife}}: The knife will sometimes destroy rocks. Rocks can be destroyed by walking into them.

== Interactions ==
* {{C|Azazel}}/{{i|Brimstone}}/{{i|Technology}}/{{i|Technology 2}}/{{i|Tech.5}}/{{i|Tech X}}: Lasers will sometimes destroy rocks and gains increased [[knockback]], but will not open doors or [[Secret Room]] entrances.
** {{dlc|r+}} Lasers can now open doors.
* {{i|Dr. Fetus}} / {{i|Epic Fetus}}: Explosions retain the extra damage and knockback, but cannot destroy Key Blocks.
* [[Spectral tears]]: Tears continue to destroy obstacles.
* {{i|Spirit Sword}}: Sword swings and spin attacks cannot destroy rocks, only its projectiles.
* {{C|Tainted Lilith}}: The damage from hitting enemies with the fetus is affected by Terra's damage randomization.

