== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Terra|Terra]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod.
* "Terra" is the word for "[[Wikipedia:earth|earth]]" in Latin and some of its descendant languages, and is sometimes used to distinguish the Earth of the Solar System from other inhabited planets in science fiction.

